        <name>mbedtls_version_check_feature</name>
        <param>
          <type>const char *</type>
          <declname>feature</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Check if support for a feature was compiled into this Mbed TLS binary. This allows you to see at runtime if the library was for instance compiled with or without Multi-threading support. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>only checks against defines in the sections &quot;System
                 support&quot;, &quot;Mbed TLS modules&quot; and &quot;Mbed TLS feature
                 support&quot; in <ref refid="mbedtls__config_8h" kindref="compound">mbedtls_config.h</ref></para></simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>feature</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The string for the define to check (e.g. &quot;MBEDTLS_SSL_SRV_C&quot;)</para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>0 if the feature is present, -1 if the feature is not present and -2 if support for feature checking as a whole was not compiled in. </para></simplesect>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
